<h1 class="about-h">About ZANYIAH.</h1>
<ul class="about-list">
<li>What I do exists somewhere between media and technology. I’ve found it easier to show than explain.</li>
<li>I am in love with design, don’t have the skills to be a visual designer (working on it) and compensate by researching. And spending too much time with designers.</li>
<li>I graduated with a B.S. in Innovation, Society, and Technology + Agile Project Management. I participated in a Global Workplace Program in London, UK and the Media and Changing Communities program in Copenhagen, DK. Most recently, I interned at Netflix in the Content Operations and Innovation org in Los Angeles, CA.</li>
<li>I grew up somewhere on the East Coast (hint: King Neptune) and I love to travel. This summer, I visited Angeles City in the Philippines to (1) process the past 4 years (2) work on this site and (3) practice ballroom dancing with my Lola.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="about-h">About this site.</h2>
<p>This is not a conventional portfolio. It is a living collection of finished and unfinished work, references, and questions.</p>
<p>This site is an effort to move from curating and consuming toward making, sharing, and participating.</p>
<p>It also memorializes my earlier work to see changes in my writing, taste, and understanding over time.</p>
<p>This site will keep growing. I invite you to <a class="internal" href="/#sec-nodes" data-swap>follow a trail</a>, {% ext "https://www.are.na/zanyiah-hill-milling", "make a connection of your own" %}, or {% ext "https://www.linkedin.com/in/zyhillmi/", "start a conversation" %}.</p>
<p>Welcome to my body of work.</p>

